# A home-made jetpack: two cardboard tubes with red paper nose cones, parcel-tape bands and a
# felt-tip lightning bolt, strapped on the back. The tubes stand behind the body (the -back
# frames); the strap crosses in front. cardboard-jetpack-flame-0/-1 add little flame puffs under
# the nozzles. Back items hang on the duck's neck anchor.
name: cardboard-jetpack
size: 27x28
anchor: neck 26 15
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  L #d4a373
  M #a67c52
  D #7d5a37
  T #efe0c0
  R #e74c3c
  O #f39c12
  Y #ffe066

